{"4057260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Piperspace", "steam_appid": 4057260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken from your cryopod to discover something is wrong with the ship. But the ship is in denial. Discover the real reason you were awoken as you explore the ship, repurpose its systems and jury-rig parts to reach your destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/df13ef4d01ed035d3dacf71ab62d838c.poster.avif?t=1778669485\" width=480 height=24 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/df13ef4d01ed035d3dacf71ab62d838c.webm?t=1778669485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/df13ef4d01ed035d3dacf71ab62d838c.mp4?t=1778669485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\">  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pipes, oh so many pipes</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore expansive locations</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build on walls, floors and ceilings. Complete freedom!</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coop multiplayer</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero inventory management</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/61f3135b8e2c55ec04dd0bf373b54df9.poster.avif?t=1778669485\" width=480 height=24 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/61f3135b8e2c55ec04dd0bf373b54df9.webm?t=1778669485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/61f3135b8e2c55ec04dd0bf373b54df9.mp4?t=1778669485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the ship doesn't want to be fixed, you'll have to jury rig a solution on top of the existing connections. Luckily you're the only one awake on this ship, because those corridors are about to get a lot tighter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/489dadb2b2bf1d741f5f78341323f198.poster.avif?t=1778669485\" width=480 height=24 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/489dadb2b2bf1d741f5f78341323f198.webm?t=1778669485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/489dadb2b2bf1d741f5f78341323f198.mp4?t=1778669485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build where ever you want. Every wall, floor and ceiling is available for your creative problem solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/3e1d490ad07ed8e1686437de095c83ad.poster.avif?t=1778669485\" width=480 height=24 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/3e1d490ad07ed8e1686437de095c83ad.webm?t=1778669485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/3e1d490ad07ed8e1686437de095c83ad.mp4?t=1778669485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge whatever the ship will let you to bootstrap your own production. Convert each room into something that helps your own goals. This ship isn't going to repair itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/dc3e6d5b50e1cee450a73b3b1a6db0f0.poster.avif?t=1778669485\" width=480 height=24 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/dc3e6d5b50e1cee450a73b3b1a6db0f0.webm?t=1778669485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/dc3e6d5b50e1cee450a73b3b1a6db0f0.mp4?t=1778669485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items exist in your personal pocket dimension. No weight limit, no storage containers, no micromanagement, so you can spend more time building pipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/97b676ddaa00d70dc6540cf4aab0ce03.poster.avif?t=1778669485\" width=480 height=24 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/97b676ddaa00d70dc6540cf4aab0ce03.webm?t=1778669485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/97b676ddaa00d70dc6540cf4aab0ce03.mp4?t=1778669485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your friends with frictionless online coop. Players can join and leave as they like. The game is playable from the very first moment in multiplayer, as is the demo - no hours long singleplayer tutorial required.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken from your cryopod to discover something is wrong with the ship. But the ship is in denial. Discover the real reason you were awoken as you explore the ship, repurpose its systems and jury-rig parts to reach your destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/df13ef4d01ed035d3dacf71ab62d838c.poster.avif?t=1778669485\" width=480 height=24 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/df13ef4d01ed035d3dacf71ab62d838c.webm?t=1778669485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/df13ef4d01ed035d3dacf71ab62d838c.mp4?t=1778669485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\">  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pipes, oh so many pipes</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore expansive locations</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build on walls, floors and ceilings. Complete freedom!</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coop multiplayer</p></li>  <li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero inventory management</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/61f3135b8e2c55ec04dd0bf373b54df9.poster.avif?t=1778669485\" width=480 height=24 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/61f3135b8e2c55ec04dd0bf373b54df9.webm?t=1778669485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/61f3135b8e2c55ec04dd0bf373b54df9.mp4?t=1778669485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the ship doesn't want to be fixed, you'll have to jury rig a solution on top of the existing connections. Luckily you're the only one awake on this ship, because those corridors are about to get a lot tighter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/489dadb2b2bf1d741f5f78341323f198.poster.avif?t=1778669485\" width=480 height=24 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/489dadb2b2bf1d741f5f78341323f198.webm?t=1778669485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/489dadb2b2bf1d741f5f78341323f198.mp4?t=1778669485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build where ever you want. Every wall, floor and ceiling is available for your creative problem solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/3e1d490ad07ed8e1686437de095c83ad.poster.avif?t=1778669485\" width=480 height=24 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/3e1d490ad07ed8e1686437de095c83ad.webm?t=1778669485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/3e1d490ad07ed8e1686437de095c83ad.mp4?t=1778669485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge whatever the ship will let you to bootstrap your own production. Convert each room into something that helps your own goals. This ship isn't going to repair itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/dc3e6d5b50e1cee450a73b3b1a6db0f0.poster.avif?t=1778669485\" width=480 height=24 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/dc3e6d5b50e1cee450a73b3b1a6db0f0.webm?t=1778669485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/dc3e6d5b50e1cee450a73b3b1a6db0f0.mp4?t=1778669485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items exist in your personal pocket dimension. No weight limit, no storage containers, no micromanagement, so you can spend more time building pipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/97b676ddaa00d70dc6540cf4aab0ce03.poster.avif?t=1778669485\" width=480 height=24 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/97b676ddaa00d70dc6540cf4aab0ce03.webm?t=1778669485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/extras/97b676ddaa00d70dc6540cf4aab0ce03.mp4?t=1778669485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your friends with frictionless online coop. Players can join and leave as they like. The game is playable from the very first moment in multiplayer, as is the demo - no hours long singleplayer tutorial required.</p>", "short_description": "A first person building game where every problem is solved with pipes.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057260/4a41baa5f819c0d4d7454f78419c8322ef91bc82/header.jpg?t=1778669485", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steams